		<label>arabian horse</label>
		<description>A refined, hot-blooded horse breed originative of desert climates. Renowned for its distinctive head shape, high tail carriage, and exceptional endurance, the Arabian is exceptionally fast and well-suited for fast caravan sprints, though its highly active metabolism requires consistent feeding.</description>
